---
/**
 * Text generation lesson — illustration #1.
 *
 * The autoregressive prediction loop: input runs through the
 * transformer (all blocks), the last position produces logits,
 * softmax turns those into probabilities, the model samples one
 * token, the new token appends to the input, and the loop runs
 * again. KV cache shown as a dashed feedback path that lets
 * subsequent passes skip recomputing prior K/V.
 */
---

<figure class="cw-illus">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 800 360" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="pl-title pl-desc">
		<title id="pl-title">The autoregressive prediction loop</title>
		<desc id="pl-desc">A vertical loop diagram. The input tokens enter the transformer (all stacked blocks). The top of the stack at the last position produces logits across the vocabulary. Softmax turns the logits into a probability distribution. The model samples one token from that distribution. The new token appends to the input, and the loop runs again. A dashed feedback path indicates the KV cache: keys and values from prior positions are reused so each new pass only computes K and V for the one new token.</desc>

		<defs>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-pl" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor"/>
			</marker>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-pl-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#7c3aed"/>
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<rect x="290" y="20" width="220" height="40" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="38" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">input tokens</text>
		<text x="400" y="52" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">prompt + tokens generated so far</text>

		<line x1="400" y1="60" x2="400" y2="84" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-pl)"/>

		<rect x="290" y="86" width="220" height="48" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">transformer (N blocks)</text>
		<text x="400" y="124" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">attention + FFN + residuals + layer norm, stacked</text>

		<line x1="400" y1="134" x2="400" y2="158" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-pl)"/>

		<rect x="290" y="160" width="220" height="40" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="178" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">logits (vocab_size)</text>
		<text x="400" y="192" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">final linear projects d_model -> vocab_size</text>

		<line x1="400" y1="200" x2="400" y2="224" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-pl)"/>

		<rect x="290" y="226" width="220" height="40" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="244" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">softmax</text>
		<text x="400" y="258" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">probability distribution over vocab</text>

		<line x1="400" y1="266" x2="400" y2="290" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-pl)"/>

		<rect x="290" y="292" width="220" height="44" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2"/>
		<text x="400" y="312" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="600">sample one token</text>
		<text x="400" y="328" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">greedy / top-k / top-p, with temperature</text>

		<path d="M 510 314 L 620 314 L 620 40 L 510 40" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-pl-accent)"/>
		<text x="700" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#7c3aed" font-style="italic">append the</text>
		<text x="700" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#7c3aed" font-style="italic">new token,</text>
		<text x="700" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#7c3aed" font-style="italic">loop</text>

		<path d="M 290 110 L 180 110 L 180 50 L 290 50" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4 3" opacity="0.55" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-pl)"/>
		<text x="100" y="78" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">KV cache</text>
		<text x="100" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6" font-style="italic">(reuse prior K, V)</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>Autoregressive generation. Each pass produces one new token, which appends to the input and triggers the next pass. KV caching reuses keys and values from prior positions so subsequent passes only do new work for the one new token, not for the whole sequence.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cw-illus { margin: 1.75rem auto; max-width: 100%; }
	.cw-illus svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 780px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cw-illus figcaption { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-style: italic; }
</style>
